{
  "_comment": "Hand-curated exceptions for src/engine/participle.ts. Keyed by lemma (stable across book re-ingestion — chapter JSONs are regenerated wholesale by tools/ingest/ingest-book.mjs). schwaStems/noGe/separable match by endsWith so prefixed variants (beschilderen, opleveren) are covered by their base verb.",
